kb/archive/[REDACTED]-nightly.md:355:- [[REDACTED]03T17:28:59Z] Taylor/finding — park-unpark-live-gap-A-B-C-XONG: {"doc": "mike/agents/Taylor/research/park_unpark_live_wiring_20260803.md", "job": "Taylor_20260803_171515", "A_double_check": {"A1_allocator_band_KHONG_sinh_lenh": "XAC NHAN pt_v22_dt5g.py:765-808 nam o buoc [8] Building combined logs = LOP KE TOAN HAU KY. nav_bal/nav_lag da mo phong DOC LAP xong truoc do; allocator chi nhan 2 so vo huong cb/cl roi scale ledger bang fb=cap_b/navb_c. KHONG feedback vao sizing vi the. => KHONG TON TAI lop dich band->trim PARK, ke ca trong backtest.", "A2_golive_doc_so_mo_phong": "DUNG. golive_recommend_v23.py:748-759 doc pt_v22_dt5g_logs.csv (~48 ty). golive_v23_status.json hom nay: w_lag_current=0.495, alloc_note=as of [REDACTED] trong khi date=[REDACTED]03.", "A3_smoking_gun_[REDACTED]_0731": "BAC BO. w_cur sim 07-31 = 0.495 vs target 0.50 => lech 0.5pp < band 10pp => band_breach=false LA DUNG. 30.5% cua DollarBill vs 49.5% cua sim KHAC MAU SO (DollarBill chi dem co phieu, sim dem cash+co phieu+ETF park). Phan chenh chinh la PARK.", "A4_khong_co_PARK_EXIT": "DUNG. 3 play_type LAG_HI/LAG_LO/CUSTOM30V_8L; CUSTOM30V_8L la xoay vong ma trong ro, khong phai exit. PARK_EXIT khong ton tai o dau trong code.", "A5_BO_SUNG_LON": "Engine co BA duong PARK: (1) PREFILL_STATE_REBAL dong 899-980 BAN moi phien VO DIEU KIEN khi park>target+0.5%pool; (2) JIT_FOR_BA_BUY dong 1139-1199 BAN theo tung lenh mua; (3) POST_FILL_SWEEP dong 1358-1420 MUA. LIVE chi co duong (3) va chi duoi dang VAN XUOI (golive_recommend_v23.py:1124 in cau park 70% cash nhan roi, khong co target_park/delta/lenh). => tien vao PARK khong co duong ra = BANH COC.", "A6_do_tren_DNSE_that_08-03": {"[REDACTED]": "PARK(tru CAPIT) 642.46tr, totalCash 14.60tr, pool 657.05tr, target 70% = 459.94tr => PARK VUOT TRAN 182.52tr; cash share 2.2% (rule doi 30%)", "[REDACTED]": "PARK(tru CAPIT va DGC excluded) 297.63tr, cash 12.27tr => vuot 80.70tr, cash share 4.0%", "doi_chieu": "plan_[REDACTED]_[REDACTED].json deferred_total_with_fee=171,096,626 (TV2 76.04tr + APF 95.06tr), available_cash=4,821,143, orders=0 HOLD ALL, ly do ghi nguyen van Cho user nap von moi. => 182.5tr vuot tran vs 171.1tr can: TUAN THU DUNG rule 70/30 da backtest la du tien, KHONG can nap them dong nao."}, "A7_BLOCKER": "Live KHONG tag book per-lot. Quy PARK phai suy theo TEN MA => sai duoc: plan hom nay tu ghi book_note=LAG/PARK cho VPB; PVT/VNM/SAB/SIP/NCT vua CAPIT vua park; ro [REDACTED]V doi theo quy (rebal 2026-05-05). P0 bat buoc truoc L1/L2: ghi book/play_type vao journal luc FILL roi dung vi the theo lo FIFO tu journal."}, "B_thiet_ke": "2 lop, ca hai deu la PORT nguyen trang co che da co, 0 tham so moi. L1 park-target compliance = port PREFILL_STATE_REBAL (nguong 0.005 va tran _etf_day_cap copy tu dong 918-921), chay hang ngay vo dieu kien, UU TIEN 1 (du dong case hien tai). L2 JIT unpark = port JIT_FOR_BA_BUY (x0.99, FIFO, friction). Trim pro-rata theo trong so ro (engine mo phong PARK la 1 ro chia lo; live la 30 ma rieng le => ban sach vai ma = doi cau truc ro = doi thu da backtest). Tran/phien = _etf_day_cap co san, KHONG dat tran moi. KHONG them dieu kien phu cho L1. Rang buoc: doc DNSE khong doc BQ, dung availableCash (totalCash gom 9.78tr co tuc chua ve), ton trong excluded_tickers (DGC nam trong ro [REDACTED]V nhung CAM trim), CAPIT stop_exempt khong phai PARK cam trim, sizing theo active_nav.", "C_ablation": {"harness_v1_LA_NO_OP": "Vong truoc dung PYTHONPATH nhung pt_v23_audit_2014.py:42 goi sys.path.insert(0,WORKDIR) TRUOC import => production luon thang. 3 CSV giong het tung byte (md5 7d053e6201c9). Da sua bang run_leg.py pre-seed sys.modules + 2 assert + gate md5 phai KHAC nhau.", "gate": "PASS ca hai: chan A tai lap CHINH XAC pin 08-03 (NAV 1178.01B, CAGR 28.86, Sharpe 1.90, DD -17.8, Calmar 1.62) va CSV md5 TRUNG KHIT ban production; 3 md5 v2 khac nhau; selfcheck 0 VND ca 3 chan.", "ket_qua": "A(on) 28.86%/1.90/-17.8%/1.62 | B(off, co lenh) 28.42%/1.90/-17.7%/1.60 | C(skip = LIVE) 28.08%/1.88/-17.9%/1.57. 8995 luot mua bi bo trong 12.46 nam => JIT khong phai su kien hiem.", "CANH_BAO_QUAN_TRONG": "A-C toan ky +0.78pp NHUNG IS2014-19 +1.61pp va OOS2020-26 -0.14pp (AM); LOO bo rieng 2023 => +0.00pp (mot nam ganh tron edge); C thang A o 6/13 nam; Sharpe/MaxDD gan nhu khong doi. => CAM TRICH +0.78pp NHU LOI ICH CUA VIEC WIRE. Thieu JIT khong chung minh duoc la lam mat tien; no lam DUONG DI cua live khac duong da mo phong (lech +-8pp moi nam ca hai chieu) = loi TRUNG THUC MO HINH (fidelity), khong phai bo lo alpha do duoc.", "pham_vi_CHUA_DO": "Ablation chi tat duong 2. Duong 1 (PREFILL_STATE_REBAL khoi 4c) VAN CHAY o ca 3 chan => ngay ca chan C van tu trim PARK ve 70% moi phien, thu live khong he lam. A-C la CAN DUOI cua khoang cach live-vs-backtest. Con no chan thu 4 (tat 4c) de dinh luong rieng L1 — CAN THEM 1 VONG."}, "luan_cu_de_wire": "TUAN THU SPEC, KHONG PHAI ALPHA: (a) live dang VI PHAM rule parking 70/30 ma chinh no da backtest; (b) moi so da pin (28.86%) sinh tren mot duong thi hanh ma live khong co => so pin hien KHONG MO TA live.", "trang_thai": "CHUA WIRE GI. Khong sua file production nao. quant-skeptic BAT BUOC truoc moi thay doi vao golive_recommend_v23.py hay plan generation."}
kb/archive/[REDACTED]-nightly.md:387:- [[REDACTED]03T18:00:17Z] quant-skeptic/verification — ✅ [REDACTED]VERIFY: park-unpark-live-gap-A-B-C-XONG: {"finding_topic": "park-unpark-live-gap-A-B-C-XONG", "verdict": "[REDACTED]D", "confidence": "high", "checks": {"look_ahead_leak": "pass — B2/B5 explicitly compute pool from DNSE `availableCash`+live positions, not BQ same-day (§6 CLAUDE.md rule respected); ablation C/A/B all reuse the same T+1-open fill engine, no forward column (`profit_*`, `O1W..O2Y`) touched anywhere in `simulate_holistic_nav.py` PARK code (lines 899-980, 1136-1150 read only).", "oos_robustness": "pass — independently recomputed geometric CAGR from the raw annual-return series printed in `v2_A_control.log`/`v2_C_skip.log`: IS(2014-19) A=27.04% C=25.43% (matches claim to the bp); OOS(2020-26) A=30.15% C=30.29% (matches claim to the bp). Finding correctly bans citing the +0.78pp Full-period number as alpha given OOS≈flat.", "panel_curation_bias": "pass — ablation runs on `universe_pit` (current official R3 universe per repo memory), not a curated/hardcoded list; PARK basket is `tav2_bq.[REDACTED]v_8l` read live, not hand-picked.", "reproducibility_selfcheck": "pass — reran all verification myself: (1) `sys.path.insert(0,WORKDIR)` at `pt_v23_audit_2014.py:42` before `import simulate_holistic_nav` confirmed, validating the v1-no-op claim; (2) md5 of the 3 v1 legs all `7d053e62...` (byte-identical, no-op) vs v2 legs `7d053e62`/`fe06277c`/`133a4c0a` (A matches production/no-op exactly, B/C differ) — exactly as claimed; (3) `[selfcheck BAL]`/`[selfcheck LAG]` = 0 VND in all 3 v2 logs; (4) diff of the exp-copy engine vs production `simulate_holistic_nav.py` shows the patch touches ONLY the `JIT_FOR_BA_BUY` branch (~line 1136-1150), leaving `PREFILL_STATE_REBAL` (899-980) byte-identical in all 3 legs — substantiates the C4 'A-C is a lower bound' caveat.", "param_overfit": "pass — 0 new parameters; L1/L2 designs cite only pre-existing engine constants (`0.005` threshold at `simulate_holistic_nav.py:913`, `etf_frac=0.70` from `PARK_STATES`, `_etf_day_cap`, FIFO, `×0.99`) already embedded in the pinned backtest, not re-tuned.", "capacity_adv_realism": "fail — read `_etf_day_cap()` at `simulate_holistic_nav.py:440-446`: it is `etf_liquidity_pct × etf_adv_lookup.get(today)`, i.e. calibrated to **E1VFVN30 ETF's own ADV**, not to the ADV of the 30 discrete equities in the live [REDACTED]V basket. Section B2/B4 proposes reusing this exact cap verbatim as the live per-session trim ceiling ('không đặt trần %/phiên mới... `_etf_day_cap` đã có sẵn') while simultaneously acknowledging (B4) that live PARK is '30 mã riêng lẻ' vs the engine's pooled-ETF abstraction — but never reconciles that the liquidity ceiling itself, not just the trim ORDER, was pooled-ETF-shaped. Applying an ETF-ADV-sized VND cap to trims spread across up to 30 individual (some potentially illiquid) value names risks breaching per-name %ADV even while staying under the aggregate cap.", "arithmetic_mechanism": "pass — verified the '6/13 years C beats A' sub-claim by hand from the raw annual tables: C > A in exactly 2016, 2017, 2019, 2020, 2022, 2025 (6 years) — exact match to the doc's named years. `w_lag_current=0.495`/`alloc_note='as of [REDACTED]'`/`band_breach=false`/`n_park=30`/`park_rebal_date=2026-05-05`/`etf_park_frac=0.7` all reproduced byte-for-byte from `data/golive_v23_status.json`. `deferred_total_with_fee_vnd=171,096,626`, `available_cash_vnd=4,821,143`, `orders=[]` and the literal deferred_reason text reproduced from `data/trade_plans/plan_[REDACTED]_[REDACTED].json`. `totalCash=14,596,244` reproduced from `dnse_raw_[REDACTED]03.jsonl`. Mechanism claims (allocator is post-hoc scalar accounting, not order-generating; DT5G is untouched by this whole topic) are consistent with code."}, "independent_recompute": "Recomputed IS/OOS geometric CAGR from the raw per-year sys-return series in v2_A_control.log and v2_C_skip.log: got A_IS=27.04%, C_IS=25.43%, A_OOS=30.15%, C_OOS=30.29% — matches the finding's C3 table to the basis point. Also reproduced md5 clustering (v1 3-way tie, v2 3-way distinct with A==production), the 6/13-year win count, and every cited field in golive_v23_status.json / plan_[REDACTED]_[REDACTED].json / dnse_raw_[REDACTED]03.jsonl exactly.", "killer_objection": "The proposed L1/L2 trim cap (`_etf_day_cap`) is derived from E1VFVN30 ETF ADV, not from the ADV of the 30 individual [REDACTED]V names that live would actually be trimming — the design reuses a pooled-liquidity number for a fundamentally different (per-name, possibly less liquid) execution surface without checking the reconciliation. This is a real, unaddressed capacity risk in section B (not yet wired), distinct from the otherwise well-substantiated diagnostic finding.", "recommended_reruns": ["Before implementing L1/L2: pull per-ticker `Trading_Value_1M_P50`/ADV for the current 30-name [REDACTED]V basket and compare against the VND size a single day's `_etf_day_cap()` would authorize a trim of, split pro-rata across names — confirm no single name's implied trim exceeds a sane %ADV.", "Run the promised 4th ablation leg (disable block 4c / PREFILL_STATE_REBAL) to isolate L1's standalone contribution, as the doc itself flags as outstanding.", "Complete the P0 book/play_type-at-fill journal tagging (A7 blocker) before computing any live `park_mv_live`, since the current name-based inference is already known to misclassify at least one live position (VPB tagged 'LAG/PARK')."], "summary": "This is an unusually well-evidenced finding — I independently retraced nearly every specific claim (code line numbers, md5 hashes, JSON field values, DNSE balance figures, plan-file deferred amounts, and a from-scratch IS/OOS CAGR recompute from the raw annual-return logs) and every one matched exactly, including the self-critical parts (the v1-ablation-was-a-no-op correction, and the OOS-near-zero/LOO-2023-carries-it-all caveat that correctly bars citing +0.78pp as alpha). The core diagnosis — live implements only the buy-side of a bidirectional PARK mechanism, creating a ratchet, and is provably breaching its own backtested 70/30 parking rule today (182.5tr over cap vs 171.1tr of deferred buy need) — is solid and the ablation is honestly caveated rather than oversold. The one real gap is in the not-yet-implemented design (section B): it proposes reusing the engine's `_etf_day_cap`, which is sized to the E1VFVN30 ETF's own liquidity, as the live trim ceiling for 30 discrete individual stocks — a capacity mismatch the doc doesn't reconcile despite otherwise being very careful about not introducing new parameters. Nothing has been wired to production; this review should gate on fixing that capacity check (and the acknowledged P0 book-tagging blocker) before any code change to `golive_recommend_v23.py` or plan generation."}
